orked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 3^{x^{3} + 1} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"413b9a9f-9069-59a2-b141-4ad8f93e352d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"413b9a9f-9069-59a2-b141-4ad8f93e352d\" :question/answer-fields \"1abf5818-950c-51bd-8bed-af50aa261379\"] [:db/ensure \"413b9a9f-9069-59a2-b141-4ad8f93e352d\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"413b9a9f-9069-59a2-b141-4ad8f93e352d\"] [:db/add \"4c8f6ba8-51f7-5742-bba9-9050aa05687b\" :answer/id #uuid \"4c8f6ba8-51f7-5742-bba9-9050aa05687b\"] [:db/add \"4c8f6ba8-51f7-5742-bba9-9050aa05687b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4c8f6ba8-51f7-5742-bba9-9050aa05687b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"4c8f6ba8-51f7-5742-bba9-9050aa05687b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e4da90c2-e274-56b0-9807-b333a7e5d309\" :answer/id #uuid \"e4da90c2-e274-56b0-9807-b333a7e5d309\"] [:db/add \"e4da90c2-e274-56b0-9807-b333a7e5d309\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e4da90c2-e274-56b0-9807-b333a7e5d309\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"e4da90c2-e274-56b0-9807-b333a7e5d309\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9c5a69be-cefe-52df-96e6-f9300678896e\" :answer/id #uuid \"9c5a69be-cefe-52df-96e6-f9300678896e\"] [:db/add \"9c5a69be-cefe-52df-96e6-f9300678896e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9c5a69be-cefe-52df-96e6-f9300678896e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9c5a69be-cefe-52df-96e6-f9300678896e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d16b3564-f8b9-529a-83e2-aecdeb0e7d8e\" :answer/id #uuid \"d16b