^{x^{2} + 2} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"56f265b3-c51c-5736-be8a-2f258d133062\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"56f265b3-c51c-5736-be8a-2f258d133062\" :question/answer-fields \"90cb2d66-c3ef-5d56-b2a6-552d7ed51116\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"56f265b3-c51c-5736-be8a-2f258d133062\"] [\"c253efa8-f6ff-57c5-a379-a21582515fa5\" :answer/id #uuid \"c253efa8-f6ff-57c5-a379-a21582515fa5\"] [\"c253efa8-f6ff-57c5-a379-a21582515fa5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c253efa8-f6ff-57c5-a379-a21582515fa5\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"7d0db079-9e82-5a8d-b482-4833ddae2e29\" :answer/id #uuid \"7d0db079-9e82-5a8d-b482-4833ddae2e29\"] [\"7d0db079-9e82-5a8d-b482-4833ddae2e29\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7d0db079-9e82-5a8d-b482-4833ddae2e29\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"8ab472d9-dca8-5825-80fe-4036a57f38e4\" :answer/id #uuid \"8ab472d9-dca8-5825-80fe-4036a57f38e4\"] [\"8ab472d9-dca8-5825-80fe-4036a57f38e4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"8ab472d9-dca8-5825-80fe-4036a57f38e4\" :answer/value \"\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"887295bd-91dc-554a-8484-d91feb9f4383\" :answer/id #uuid \"887295bd-91dc-554a-8484-d91feb9f4383\"] [\"887295bd-91dc-554a-8484-d91feb9f4383\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"887295bd-91dc-554a-8484-d91feb9f4383\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"0edb568c-deae-5fc1-bf5e-fd7ee908ccda\" :answer/id #uuid \"0edb568c-deae-5fc1-bf5e-fd7ee908ccda\"] [\"0edb568c-deae-5fc1-bf5e-fd7ee908ccda\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0edb568c-deae-5fc1-bf5e-fd7ee908ccda\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"1abf5818-950c-51bd-8bed-af50aa261379\" :answer-field