" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 5^{x^{3}} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [\"cf1df7b7-519a-568e-8af7-e3c2c6f8a54c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"cf1df7b7-519a-568e-8af7-e3c2c6f8a54c\" :question/answer-fields \"6cd269fc-1596-5c60-a224-fc5781f6d7c8\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"cf1df7b7-519a-568e-8af7-e3c2c6f8a54c\"] [\"0023eb5f-e351-58cf-8ea0-d3be88ca622a\" :answer/id #uuid \"0023eb5f-e351-58cf-8ea0-d3be88ca622a\"] [\"0023eb5f-e351-58cf-8ea0-d3be88ca622a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0023eb5f-e351-58cf-8ea0-d3be88ca622a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"46a9eca7-a47e-5791-9fc7-186a631991eb\" :answer/id #uuid \"46a9eca7-a47e-5791-9fc7-186a631991eb\"] [\"46a9eca7-a47e-5791-9fc7-186a631991eb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"46a9eca7-a47e-5791-9fc7-186a631991eb\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"523e539f-a1ff-5c62-a6e3-4e51b9e9a6fe\" :answer/id #uuid \"523e539f-a1ff-5c62-a6e3-4e51b9e9a6fe\"] [\"523e539f-a1ff-5c62-a6e3-4e51b9e9a6fe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"523e539f-a1ff-5c62-a6e3-4e51b9e9a6fe\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"9dd51d92-ce65-50f7-ad0f-fe5d13ae2c54\" :answer/id #uuid \"9dd51d92-ce65-50f7-ad0f-fe5d13ae2c54\"] [\"9dd51d92-ce65-50f7-ad0f-fe5d13ae2c54\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9dd51d92-ce65-50f7-ad0f-fe5d13ae2c54\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"85eb1bb1-bdc1-5690-a641-f7ccc2fbd0c0\" :answer/id #uuid \"85eb1bb1-bdc1-5690-a641-f7ccc2fbd0c0\"] [\"85eb1bb1-bdc1-5690-a641-f7ccc2fbd0c0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"85eb1bb1-bdc1-5690-a641-f7ccc2fbd0c0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\"] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/choices \"0023eb5f-e351-58cf-8ea0-d3be88ca622a\"] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/choices \"46a9eca7-a47e-5791-9fc7-186a631991eb\"] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/choices \"523e539f-a1ff-5c62-a6e3-4e51b9e9a6fe\"] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/choices \"9dd51d92-ce65-50f7-ad0f-fe5d13ae2c54\"] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/choices \"85eb1bb1-bdc1-5690-a641-f7ccc2fbd0c0\"] [\"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\" :answer-field/correct \"85eb1bb1-bdc1-5690-a641-f7ccc2fbd0c0\"] [\"21d347ea-9600-5edd-8e03-478cdd2db340\" :question/id #uuid \"21d347ea-9600-5edd-8e03-478cdd2db340\"] [\"21d347ea-9600-5edd-8e03-478cdd2db340\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=x^{2}$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 3^{x^{2}} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"21d347ea-9600-5edd-8e03-478cdd2db340\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 3^{x^{2}} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"21d347ea-9600-5edd-8e03-478cdd2db340\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"21d347ea-9600-5edd-8e03-478cdd2db340\" :question/answer-fields \"16b6b2e2-04c7-5e1d-bcfd-6998e46dcf7c\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"21d347ea-9600-5edd-8e03-478cdd2db340\"] [\"ac108f71-110d-5def-a988-7adf10aad264\" :answer/id #uuid \"ac108f71-110d-5def-a988-7adf10aad264\"] [\"ac108f71-110d-5def-a988-7adf10aad264\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ac108f71-110d-5def-a988-7adf10aad264\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{5^{x^{2} + 2}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\"] [\"bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2\"] [\"bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2\" :answer-field/choices \"ac108f71-110d-5def-a988-7adf10aad264\"] [\"bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2\" :answer-field/correct \"ac108f71-110d-5def-a988-7adf10aad264\"] [\"a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811\" :question/id #uuid \"a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811\"] [\"a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 5^{x^{2} + 2} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{5^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 5^{x^{2} + 2} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{5^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{5^{x^{2} + 2}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811\" :question/answer-fields \"bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811\"] [\"5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482\" :answer/id #uuid \"5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482\"] [\"5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{x^{3}}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)\"] [\"489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e\"] [\"489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e\" :answer-field/choices \"5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482\"] [\"489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e\" :answer-field/correct \"5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482\"] [\"894188c0-5707-53e6-81a5-fc363874eea4\" :question/id #uuid \"894188c0-5707-53e6-81a5-fc363874eea4\"] [\"894188c0-5707-53e6-81a5-fc363874eea4\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 5^{x^{3}} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{5^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"894188c0-5707-53e6-81a5-fc363874eea4\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 5^{x^{3}} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{x^{3}}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"894188c0-5707-53e6-81a5-fc363874eea4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"894188c0-5707-53e6-81a5-fc363874eea4\" :question/answer-fields \"489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"894188c0-5707-53e6-81a5-fc363874eea4\"] [\"6480e7e6-3c5a-5fe2-940b-2ae030fe56fc\" :answer/id #uuid \"6480e7e6-3c5a-5fe2-940b-2ae030fe56fc\"] [\"6480e7e6-3c5a-5fe2-940b-2ae030fe56fc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6480e7e6-3c5a-5fe2-940b-2ae030fe56fc\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{2 x^{2} + 1}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)\"] [\"a91505b9-7ccc-5893-8249-ac5c11097a17\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a91505b9-7ccc-5893-8249-ac5c11097a17\"] [\"a91505b9-7ccc-5893-8249-ac5c11097a17\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"a91505b9-7ccc-5893-8249-ac5c11097a17\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"a91505b9-7ccc-5893-8249-ac5c11097a17\" :answer-field/choices \"6480e7e6-3c5a-5fe2-940b-2ae030fe56fc\"] [\"a91505b9-7ccc-5893-8249-ac5c11097a17\" :answer-field/correct \"6480e7e6-3c5a-5fe2-940b-2ae030fe56fc\"] [\"77ac9561-e3f4-5545-80ac-69563b726f44\" :question/id #uuid \"77ac9561-e3f4-5545-80ac-69563b726f44\"] [\"77ac9561-e3f4-5545-80ac-69563b726f44\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3^{2 x^{2} + 1} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{3^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"77ac9561-e3f4-5545-80ac-69563b726f44\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x^{2} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3^{2 x^{2} + 1} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{2 x^{2} + 1}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"77ac9561-e3f4-5545-80ac-69563b726f44\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"77ac9561-e3f4-5545-80ac-69563b726f44\" :question/answer-fields \"a91505b9-7ccc-5893-8249-ac5c11097a17\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"77ac9561-e3f4-5545-80ac-69563b726f44\"] [\"52cb5d68-fbce-54d3-a60a-d42f96fd9126\" :answer/id #uuid \"52cb5d68-fbce-54d3-a60a-d42f96fd9126\"] [\"52cb5d68-fbce-54d3-a60a-d42f96fd9126\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"52cb5d68-fbce-54d3-a60a-d42f96fd9126\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{x^{3} + 1}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)\"] [\"7baf5f93-ef37-5cff-bc22-0299a3588633\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7baf5f93-ef37-5cff-bc22-0299a3588633\"] [\"7baf5f93-ef37-5cff-bc22-0299a3588633\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"7baf5f93-ef37-5cff-bc22-0299a3588633\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"7baf5f93-ef37-5cff-bc22-0299a3588633\" :answer-field/choices \"52cb5d68-fbce-54d3-a60a-d42f96fd9126\"] [\"7baf5f93-ef37-5cff-bc22-0299a3588633\" :answer-field/correct \"52cb5d68-fbce-54d3-a60a-d42f96fd9126\"] [\"57c43d75-4152-5819-a024-e6df0b92b572\" :question/id #uuid \"57c43d75-4152-5819-a024-e6df0b92b572\"] [\"57c43d75-4152-5819-a024-e6df0b92b572\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x^{3} + 1} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{3^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"57c43d75-4152-5819-a024-e6df0b92b572\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x^{3} + 1} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{x^{3} + 1}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"57c43d75-4152-5819-a024-e6df0b92b572\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"57c43d75-4152-5819-a024-e6df0b92b572\" :question/answer-fields \"7baf5f93-ef37-5cff-bc22-0299a3588633\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"57c43d75-4152-5819-a024-e6df0b92b572\"] [\"c5db4d26-6b07-50a2-a7d0-f4f9c837d42c\" :answer/id #uuid \"c5db4d26-6b07-50a2-a7d0-f4f9c837d42c\"] [\"c5db4d26-6b07-50a2-a7d0-f4f9c837d42c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c5db4d26-6b07-50a2-a7d0-f4f9c837d42c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2^{2 x^{2} + 3}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\"] [\"cff1a0bb-671b-5be7-84ec-d2b33702ef46\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cff1a0bb-671b-5be7-84ec-d2b33702ef46\"] [\"cff1a0bb-671b-5be7-84ec-d2b33702ef46\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"cff1a0bb-671b-5be7-84ec-d2b33702ef46\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"cff1a0bb-671b-5be7-84ec-d2b33702ef46\" :answer-field/choices \"c5db4d26-6b07-50a2-a7d0-f4f9c837d42c\"] [\"cff1a0bb-671b-5be7-84ec-d2b33702ef46\" :answer-field/correct \"c5db4d26-6b07-50a2-a7d0-f4f9c837d42c\"] [\"fba4c2e2-2d31-5ed7-ae9c-3ba3a86c39e2\" :question/id #uuid \"fba4c2e2-2d31-5ed7-ae9c-3ba3a86c39e2\"] [\"fba4c2e2-2d31-5ed7-ae9c-3ba3a86c39e2\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\cdot 2^{2 x^{2} + 3} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"fba4c2e2-2d31-5ed7-ae9c-3ba3a86c39e2\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x^{2} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\cdot 2^{2 x^{2} + 3} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2^{2 x^{2} + 3}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"fba4c2e2-2d31-5ed7-ae9c-3ba3a86c39e2\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"fba4c2e2-2d31-5ed7-ae9c-3ba3a86c39e2\" :question/answer-fields \"cff1a0bb-671b-5be7-84ec-d2b33702ef46\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"fba4c2e2-2d31-5ed7-ae9c-3ba3a86c39e2\"] [\"e2e9119d-3159-5ec4-8ead-e9dfd6a1caf2\" :answer/id #uuid \"e2e9119d-3159-5ec4-8ead-e9dfd6a1caf2\"] [\"e2e9119d-3159-5ec4-8ead-e9dfd6a1caf2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e2e9119d-3159-5ec4-8ead-e9dfd6a1caf2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2^{x^{3} + 1}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\"] [\"bf71755d-a0d3-57b5-8763-4ac8ad145139\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bf71755d-a0d3-57b5-8763-4ac8ad145139\"] [\"bf71755d-a0d3-57b5-8763-4ac8ad145139\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"bf71755d-a0d3-57b5-8763-4ac8ad145139\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"bf71755d-a0d3-57b5-8763-4ac8ad145139\" :answer-field/choices \"e2e9119d-3159-5ec4-8ead-e9dfd6a1caf2\"] [\"bf71755d-a0d3-57b5-8763-4ac8ad145139\" :answer-field/correct \"e2e9119d-3159-5ec4-8ead-e9dfd6a1caf2\"] [\"359d40d4-2220-5366-a978-a9a9a350a0f2\" :question/id #uuid \"359d40d4-2220-5366-a978-a9a9a350a0f2\"] [\"359d40d4-2220-5366-a978-a9a9a350a0f2\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 2^{x^{3} + 1} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"359d40d4-2220-5366-a978-a9a9a350a0f2\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 2^{x^{3} + 1} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2^{x^{3} + 1}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"359d40d4-2220-5366-a978-a9a9a350a0f2\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"359d40d4-2220-5366-a978-a9a9a350a0f2\" :question/answer-fields \"bf71755d-a0d3-57b5-8763-4ac8ad145139\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"359d40d4-2220-5366-a978-a9a9a350a0f2\"] [\"40a6b836-8b7b-5337-8d7d-1d88337396c5\" :answer/id #uuid \"40a6b836-8b7b-5337-8d7d-1d88337396c5\"] [\"40a6b836-8b7b-5337-8d7d-1d88337396c5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"40a6b836-8b7b-5337-8d7d-1d88337396c5\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{2 x^{2} + 2}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)\"] [\"42fcc5c3-e7c7-5c41-8521-c50ff5ce56da\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"42fcc5c3-e7c7-5c41-8521-c50ff5ce56da\"] [\"42fcc5c3-e7c7-5c41-8521-c50ff5ce56da\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"42fcc5c3-e7c7-5c41-8521-c50ff5ce56da\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"42fcc5c3-e7c7-5c41-8521-c50ff5ce56da\" :answer-field/choices \"40a6b836-8b7b-5337-8d7d-1d88337396c5\"] [\"42fcc5c3-e7c7-5c41-8521-c50ff5ce56da\" :answer-field/correct \"40a6b836-8b7b-5337-8d7d-1d88337396c5\"] [\"694f8a19-cddb-5b1e-b77b-8b9cd195c174\" :question/id #uuid \"694f8a19-cddb-5b1e-b77b-8b9cd195c174\"] [\"694f8a19-cddb-5b1e-b77b-8b9cd195c174\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 5^{2 x^{2} + 2} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{5^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"694f8a19-cddb-5b1e-b77b-8b9cd195c174\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 5^{2 x^{2} + 2} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{2 x^{2} + 2}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"694f8a19-cddb-5b1e-b77b-8b9cd195c174\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"694f8a19-cddb-5b1e-b77b-8b9cd195c174\" :question/answer-fields \"42fcc5c3-e7c7-5c41-8521-c50ff5ce56da\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"694f8a19-cddb-5b1e-b77b-8b9cd195c174\"] [\"a6377cc5-9826-54a6-899c-0b253c8e88ff\" :answer/id #uuid \"a6377cc5-9826-54a6-899c-0b253c8e88ff\"] [\"a6377cc5-9826-54a6-899c-0b253c8e88ff\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a6377cc5-9826-54a6-899c-0b253c8e88ff\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{x^{3} + 2}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)\"] [\"c7179666-3e4a-56ab-bf40-d66e4adfe41a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c7179666-3e4a-56ab-bf40-d66e4adfe41a\"] [\"c7179666-3e4a-56ab-bf40-d66e4adfe41a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c7179666-3e4a-56ab-bf40-d66e4adfe41a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"c7179666-3e4a-56ab-bf40-d66e4adfe41a\" :answer-field/choices \"a6377cc5-9826-54a6-899c-0b253c8e88ff\"] [\"c7179666-3e4a-56ab-bf40-d66e4adfe41a\" :answer-field/correct \"a6377cc5-9826-54a6-899c-0b253c8e88ff\"] [\"5c977eea-335e-5055-a868-1e56d5c6fe24\" :question/id #uuid \"5c977eea-335e-5055-a868-1e56d5c6fe24\"] [\"5c977eea-335e-5055-a868-1e56d5c6fe24\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\cdot 3^{x^{3} + 2} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{3^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"5c977eea-335e-5055-a868-1e56d5c6fe24\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\cdot 3^{x^{3} + 2} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int 3^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{3^{x^{3} + 2}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"5c977eea-335e-5055-a868-1e56d5c6fe24\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"5c977eea-335e-5055-a868-1e56d5c6fe24\" :question/answer-fields \"c7179666-3e4a-56ab-bf40-d66e4adfe41a\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"5c977eea-335e-5055-a868-1e56d5c6fe24\"] [\"9475f9e5-227c-5840-b910-548f1ff669d7\" :answer/id #uuid \"9475f9e5-227c-5840-b910-548f1ff669d7\"] [\"9475f9e5-227c-5840-b910-548f1ff669d7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9475f9e5-227c-5840-b910-548f1ff669d7\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2^{2 - x^{3}}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)\"] [\"bc4c58f1-54f1-5fc4-afa2-c408278c98da\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bc4c58f1-54f1-5fc4-afa2-c408278c98da\"] [\"bc4c58f1-54f1-5fc4-afa2-c408278c98da\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"bc4c58f1-54f1-5fc4-afa2-c408278c98da\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"bc4c58f1-54f1-5fc4-afa2-c408278c98da\" :answer-field/choices \"9475f9e5-227c-5840-b910-548f1ff669d7\"] [\"bc4c58f1-54f1-5fc4-afa2-c408278c98da\" :answer-field/correct \"9475f9e5-227c-5840-b910-548f1ff669d7\"] [\"b6f971f5-bfd8-5a38-88b4-48e833781b26\" :question/id #uuid \"b6f971f5-bfd8-5a38-88b4-48e833781b26\"] [\"b6f971f5-bfd8-5a38-88b4-48e833781b26\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2^{2 - x^{3}} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"b6f971f5-bfd8-5a38-88b4-48e833781b26\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 - x^{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(- 3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2^{2 - x^{3}} x^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int 2^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2^{2 - x^{3}}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"b6f971f5-bfd8-5a38-88b4-48e833781b26\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"b6f971f5-bfd8-5a38-88b4-48e833781b26\" :question/answer-fields \"bc4c58f1-54f1-5fc4-afa2-c408278c98da\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"b6f971f5-bfd8-5a38-88b4-48e833781b26\"] [\"b4ea0e12-5465-5b19-b1c3-69ed9b030d83\" :answer/id #uuid \"b4ea0e12-5465-5b19-b1c3-69ed9b030d83\"] [\"b4ea0e12-5465-5b19-b1c3-69ed9b030d83\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b4ea0e12-5465-5b19-b1c3-69ed9b030d83\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{- x^{2}}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)\"] [\"76853170-18de-5b8b-a761-5d3ce2a7c6e6\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"76853170-18de-5b8b-a761-5d3ce2a7c6e6\"] [\"76853170-18de-5b8b-a761-5d3ce2a7c6e6\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"76853170-18de-5b8b-a761-5d3ce2a7c6e6\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"76853170-18de-5b8b-a761-5d3ce2a7c6e6\" :answer-field/choices \"b4ea0e12-5465-5b19-b1c3-69ed9b030d83\"] [\"76853170-18de-5b8b-a761-5d3ce2a7c6e6\" :answer-field/correct \"b4ea0e12-5465-5b19-b1c3-69ed9b030d83\"] [\"87ae6f03-f3fc-53f8-aa77-a7cb5f12f6bf\" :question/id #uuid \"87ae6f03-f3fc-53f8-aa77-a7cb5f12f6bf\"] [\"87ae6f03-f3fc-53f8-aa77-a7cb5f12f6bf\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 5^{- x^{2}} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{5^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"87ae6f03-f3fc-53f8-aa77-a7cb5f12f6bf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- x^{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(- 2 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 5^{- x^{2}} x\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-1\\\\left(\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n-1\\\\left(\\\\int 5^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=-1\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{u}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n-1\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{- x^{2}}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"87ae6f03-f3fc-53f8-aa77-a7cb5f12f6bf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"87ae6f03-f3fc-53f8-aa77-a7cb5f12f6bf\" :question/answer-fields \"76853170-18de-5b8b-a761-5d3ce2a7c6e6\"] [17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions \"87ae6f03-f3fc-53f8-aa77-a7cb5f12f6bf\"] [\"eec4844d-544c-5a57-b89c-ee1bd78d81e0\" :answer/id #uuid \"eec4844d-544c-5a57-b89c-ee1bd78d81e0\"] [\"eec4844d-544c-5a57-b89c-ee1bd78d81e0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"eec4844d-544c-5a57-b89c-ee1bd78d81e0\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\frac{5^{2 - x^{3}}}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\right)\"] [\"765fc159-0cc3-5241-954f-661bc69482ee\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"765fc159-0cc3-5241-954f-661bc69482ee\"] [\"765fc159-0cc3-5241-954f-661bc69482ee\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"765fc159-0cc3-5241-954f-661bc69482ee\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"765fc159-0cc3-5241-954f-661bc69482ee\" :answer-field/choices \"eec4844d-544c-5a57-b89c-ee1bd78d81e0\"] [\"765fc159-0cc3-5241-954f-661bc69482ee\" :answer-field/correct \"eec4844d-544c-5a57-b89c-ee1bd78d81e0\"] [\"06647049-685d-571a-8830-feba3fbdbb